      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I've been on version 0.9.7.1 for a couple of weeks, and I've found this FarmVille driving model is still the king of overall lateral control, even compared to the super smooth North Dakota. On the highway, ND seems superior, but for more aggressive turns, FV stays in the lane and doesn't hit curbs or cross freshly painted double yellow lines.",
